scenario noncompliance_with_subject_work_requirement_counts_as_paragraph_1_failure is, as stated in "sources/us/statutes/7/2015/d/2/A.test.yaml" at case 3:
    person_1 is a person.
    the calculation date is 2026-01-01.
    person_1 is currently subject to title iv work registration requirement.
